OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy start with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain moving
OL,7,Fnortheastwards. Turning dry and
OL,8,Fbrighter towards lunchtime, with
OL,9,Fplenty of sunshine developing for the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Breezy but feeling warm in
OL,11,Fthe sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry initially this evening,
OL,14,Fbut cloud and outbreaks of rain will
OL,15,Fspread southeastwards, perhaps turning
OL,16,Fheavy over higher ground. Rather humid
OL,17,Fbut drier and clearer from the north
OL,18,Ftowards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
